# Cortisstyle — agent orientation

Three business phases on one repo: **(1) boutique storefronts**, **(2) TR multi-tenant marketplace (Cadde)**, **(3) sell enablement**. Plus international lookbook/affiliate and Lookbook Studio.

Before non-trivial work, read `docs/agent-handoffs/00-overview.md`, then the matching section under `docs/agent-handoffs/`.

| Task area | Handoff |
|-----------|---------|
| `/`, wardrobe, affiliate | `01-international-lookbook.md` |
| `studio/`, `/api/studio` | `02-lookbook-studio.md` |
| `/tr/[slug]`, `/tr/panel`, custom domains | `03-boutique-storefronts.md` |
| `/tr` Cadde, looks, platform cart | `04-tr-marketplace.md` |
| Checkout, orders, WhatsApp, iyzico | `05-commerce-rails.md` |
| AI catalog, campaigns, TikTok growth | `06-sell-enablement.md` |
| Env, Supabase, auth | `07-platform-ops.md` |

